+## 5. Component library (exact specs)
+
+### 5.1 Button
+Base: `inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent/40`. Variants: `primary` = `bg-accent text-white hover:opacity-90`; `secondary` = `border border-border bg-panel text-ink hover:bg-panel-alt`; `chip` = `border border-border bg-panel text-muted hover:border-accent/40 hover:text-ink` — rounded-full. Sizes: `sm h-8 px-3 text-xs`, `md h-10 px-4 text-sm`, `lg h-12 px-6 text-sm`. Hover `scale:1.03` spring 400/20, tap `0.96`.
+
+### 5.2 StatusPill
+`text-[10px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5` — **rounded-full** — with inline `background: {color}1A` (10% alpha) + full-color text. Map: complete→ok, running→accent, debugging→warn, failed→error, pending→muted. Springs in `scale 0.5→1 back.out(2)`, hover 1.1, tap 0.95.
+
+### 5.3 SummaryChip (metric tile)
+`bg-base px-4 py-3.5 border border-border`; label `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-faint mb-1.5`; value `font-mono text-base font-medium` (`text-warn` when warn, else `text-ink`).
+
+### 5.4 RunStatusPill (agent runs)
+`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium`: running = `text-accent border-accent/30 bg-accent-soft` with pulsing dot; needs_review = `text-warn border-warn/30 bg-warn/10`; done = `text-ok border-ok/30 bg-ok/10`.
+
+### 5.5 Pipelines (vertical agent rails)
+Row: `flex gap-3` — 34px tile column + 2px connector + label. Tile: idle `border border-border`; active = ink/teal fill + `animate-ping` ring + spinning Loader2; done = teal-tinted border (`{ACCENT}44`) + Check; failed = `bg-error/[0.08] border-error/25` + X; debugging = `bg-warn/[0.08] border-warn/25`. Connector: `w-0.5` min-h 18px, `bg-ink/40` when done else `bg-border`. Labels: idle `text-faint`, debugging `text-warn`, active `text-ink`. GSAP entrance `{opacity:0, x:-16, scale:0.92}` stagger 0.07s `power3.out`. Accent variant (reviews) uses teal with glow `boxShadow: 0 0 14px {ACCENT}55` on the active tile.
+
+### 5.6 Agent fleet graph (ReactFlow)
+Panel: `border border-white/[0.08] bg-panel/95 shadow-m3-2 backdrop-blur-xl h-[75vh]`. Header: icon badge + agent-count chip (`border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px]`). Node: `min-w-[180px] border bg-white/[0.04] px-4 py-3` with per-hue glow `boxShadow: inset 0 0 0 1px {hue}22` + corner wash `linear-gradient(135deg, {hue}14, transparent 50%)`, icon tile `h-10 w-10` with `linear-gradient(135deg, {hue}24, {hue}10)` + hue icon. Edges: `smoothstep` animated, lane stroke `rgba(255,255,255,0.15)` w 1.5, gateway lane teal `rgba(20,184,166,0.3)`. Background grid `#22222E` gap 20. Detail drawer slides in from right (`x:20`), info blocks `border border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] p-4`.
+
+### 5.7 App chrome components
+- **CommandPalette (⌘K)**: backdrop `bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm`; dialog `max-w-lg bg-panel border-border shadow-apple-lg` at `pt-[15vh]`; search row with border-b; rows `px-3 py-2` active `bg-accent-soft text-ink`; section labels `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-faint`; footer with mono kbd hints. Entrance `{opacity:0, y:-8, scale:0.98}` 0.2s.
+- **NotificationsBell**: `w-8 h-8` + ink unread dot (`w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-ink` — circular dot); dropdown `w-80 glass shadow-xl`, rows `px-4 py-3 border-b border-border-soft`, unread hover `bg-panel-alt`.
+- **ThemeToggle**: cycles dark → light → high-contrast; segmented variant uses `bb-chip`/`bb-chip-selected`.
+- **Toggle**: track `h-5 w-9 rounded-full p-0.5`; on `bg-ink`, off `bg-border`; knob `h-4 w-4` round, spring 500/30, tap scale 0.9.
+
+### 5.8 Build workspace panels (glass-strong)
+- **TopBar**: `h-14 bg-base/70 backdrop-blur border-b border-border`, logo tile `w-7 h-7 gradient-ember` + Sparkles, breadcrumb, status pill (`border-border bg-panel/60` with pulsing dot: Ready `bg-faint`, Building `bg-ember` pulse, Refining `bg-warn` pulse, Live `bg-ok`, Failed `bg-error`), DeployButton.
+- **ChatPanel**: pipeline strip (`grid grid-cols-6 gap-1.5` tiles `h-9 w-9` per-agent hues via `color-mix(in oklab, {hue} X%, transparent)`, active tile glows `boxShadow: 0 0 16px -4px {hue}55`), auto-approve row, gate approval card (`border border-ember/30 bg-ember/10 p-3`), transcript with user bubbles (`rounded-xl border border-ember/30 bg-ember/10`, asymmetric tail corner), agent messages with hue icon tiles (`h-5 w-5` bg `color-mix(hue 14%, transparent)` + `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider` hue label), composer with `gradient-ember` rounded-full send button (ArrowUp).
+- **EditorPanel**: `grid grid-cols-[220px_minmax(0,1fr)]`, file tree with 2px ember left-rail on active file (`border-ember text-ink bg-ember/5`), tabs, "Writing" chip (`bg-ember/15 text-ember` + blinking dot), Monaco `vs-dark` fontSize 13. Loading: dashed orbit spinner (`border-2 border-dashed border-ember/40 animate-spin` 6s) + shimmering skeleton lines.
+- **PreviewPanel**: macOS browser frame (`bg-[#fafafa]` light chrome — traffic lights `#ec6a5e`/`#f4bf4f`/`#61c454` circular dots), Live chip `bg-ok/15 text-ok`, QA gauge (SVG circle `stroke #34D399`, score + `/ 100`).
+- **StatusBar**: `h-8 bg-base/70 backdrop-blur border-t` with connection dot (pulsing glow), debug/error indicators, mono counters (`font-mono tabular-nums` + Cpu/Zap icons).
+
+### 5.9 Agent run panels (PM tabs)
+- **AgentRunShell**: `bb-panel overflow-hidden`; header with per-hue icon tile (`h-9 w-9` bg `{hue}24`); body `grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_220px]`; right rail with `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-faint` labels, mono metric rows, `h-[3px]` progress bar with teal fill, mono log lines with colored timestamps.
+- **RunCard**: `border p-3.5`; accent variant `border-accent/30 bg-accent-soft`. Section label: `text-[10px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-faint`.
+- **Badges**: story count `border border-border px-2 py-0.5 text-[10.5px] text-muted`; priority P0 `text-warn border-warn/30`.
+
+### 5.10 Charts (recharts)
+- **ChartContainer**: ResponsiveContainer, default 220px, grows in `{opacity:0, scaleY:0.85, origin bottom}` 0.6s.
+- **ChartTooltip**: `glass rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs` with 8px color dots + mono values.
+- Styling: grid `#22222E`, axis `#5A5A6B` fontSize 10 no ticks; bars `radius [4,4,0,0]` (rounded top); revenue area `#E8823C` strokeWidth 2 fillOpacity 0.15; stacked success `#34D399` / fail `#EF4444`; per-series colors from the agent hue cycle.
+
+## 6. Motion language (uniform rules)
+
+- **Entrances**: framer-motion variants `fadeUp {y:24}`, `fadeIn`, `scaleIn {scale:0.92}`, `slideInLeft {x:-32}`, `slideInRight {x:32}`, `flipIn`; `staggerContainer` (staggerChildren 0.06, delayChildren 0.1) + `staggerItem {opacity:0, y:16, scale:0.97}`. Page fade `{opacity:0, y:10→16}` 0.35–0.5s, ease `[0.16,1,0.3,1]` or `[0.22,1,0.36,1]`.
+- **Springs**: stiffness 300–500, damping 15–32. Buttons hover 1.03/tap 0.96; cards hover `{y:-4, scale:1.01}`; pills `back.out(2)`.
+- **GSAP**: list staggers 0.03–0.08s (`power2/3.out`, `back.out`), count-ups (`power2.out` 800–900ms), infinite pulses gated on reduced motion.
+- **Every animation** respects `prefers-reduced-motion` — disable when set.
+- **Micro-labels** are always `text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider/widest text-faint`; status colors on pills at 10–15% alpha backgrounds.
+
+## 7. Tech stack to implement in
+
+- React + Vite, Tailwind CSS v3 (CSS vars + `rgb(var(--x) / <alpha-value>)`), lucide-react icons, framer-motion (`motion/react`), gsap for entrances/count-ups, recharts for charts, ReactFlow for the fleet graph, optional three-globe/cobe for the launch globe.
+- Semantic classes only: `bg-base`, `bg-panel`, `bg-panel-alt`, `text-ink`, `text-muted`, `text-faint`, `text-accent`, `bg-accent/10`, `bg-accent-soft`, `border-outline`, `shadow-m3`, `shadow-m3-2`, `glass`, `glass-strong`, `gradient-ember`, `bb-btn bb-btn-primary`, `bb-input`, `bb-chip`.
+- **Rounded corners (Apple x M3)** — use standard rounded utilities: `rounded-full` for pill controls, buttons, chips, badges, status dots, and avatars; `rounded-xl` (12px) for cards; `rounded-2xl` (16px) for panels and dialogs; `rounded-lg` (8px) for inputs.
+- Responsive: `mx-auto px-4 md:px-8` containers, `grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3` stat grids, dock/panels collapse to bottom tab bars on mobile.
+
+Build the full shell first (tokens → CSS classes → shell → page layout), then the components, then populate pages. Match classes verbatim.
